2. countdown begins
3. each receives same structured exam
4. each completes independently

==========================================================

Scoring
-------

Based on:

• accuracy
• speed
• difficulty weighting

==========================================================

Leaderboard Behavior
--------------------

Hidden for most of match.

Only revealed:

