Ghost System (IMPORTANT)
------------------------

If player leaves early:

→ replaced by “ghost bot”

==========================================================

Ghost bot rules:

• uses player’s current score snapshot
• DOES NOT answer further questions
• final score is frozen projection

Example:

Player leaves at 3/10 correct

Ghost = locked 3/10

This prevents farming exploits.

